<h1 style="margin: 0 0 16px; font-size: 22px;">Verify your email address</h1>
<p style="margin: 0 0 16px;">Hi {{name}},</p>
<p style="margin: 0 0 24px;">Thanks for creating a TestTix account. Confirm that this is your email address to be able to buy tickets.</p>
<p style="margin: 0 0 24px;">
  <a href="{{verifyUrl}}" style="display: inline-block; padding: 12px 24px; background-color: #4f46e5; color: #ffffff; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 6px; font-weight: 600;">Verify email address</a>
</p>
<p style="margin: 0 0 8px;">Or open this link:</p>
<p style="margin: 0 0 24px; word-break: break-all;"><a href="{{verifyUrl}}" style="color: #4f46e5;">{{verifyUrl}}</a></p>
<p style="margin: 0; color: #52525b;">The link works for {{expiresIn}}. If you didn't create an account, you can ignore this email.</p>
